olusi obat herbal untuk sakit gigi ini supaya tidak terulang kembali.\nKalau kita mencoba mempelajari kembali tentang ramuan alami nenek moyang kita dahulu termasuk Nabi kita, beliau menggosok gigi dengan kayu dari siwak.\nDan warisan dari nenek moyang bangsa Indonesia yaitu obat sakit gigi dengan cengkeh.\nSekarang sudah ada pasta gigi herbal yang mengandung kedua bahan tersebut.\nYa hebsdent namanya sebagai pasta gigi herbal yang bisa membantu untuk menyembuhkan sakit gigi dan menjaga supaya tidak terulang lagi.\nRata-rata orang yang mulai memakai pasta gigi hesbdent ini terasa khasiatnya.\nBuktinya banyak orang yang saya sarankan untuk memakai pasta gigi hebsdent ini akhirnya memakai pasta gigi ini untuk sekeluarga.\nSebab banyak cerita testimoni bagi mereka yang telah memakai pasta gigi hebsdent ini gigi mereka menjadi lagi sensitif dan tak pernah lagi sakit gigi.","tokens":["Ob","at"," Her","bal"," Un","t","uk"," Sak","it"," G","igi"," Yang"," B","isa"," Dip","ak","ai"," Sec","ara"," B","ers","ama"," Dal","am"," Sat","u"," Kel","u","arg","a","D","ari"," memb","aca"," jud","ul"," di","atas"," se","ben","arn","ya"," kur","ang"," mas","uk"," di"," a","kal",".","\n","Ap","ak","ah"," mem","ang"," ad","a"," 1"," bu","ah"," produ","k"," ob","at"," s","ak","it"," gig","i"," yang"," b","isa"," dip","ak","ai"," b","ers","ama",".","\n","B","ias","anya"," yang"," k","ita"," t","ahu"," b","ah","wa"," sat","u"," mac","am"," ob","at"," b","isa"," dip","ak","ai"," h","anya"," unt","uk"," sat","u"," or","ang",".","\n","S","eb","en","arn","ya"," k","al","au"," k","ita"," tel","ah"," t","ers","er","ang"," s","ak","it"," gig","i"," ras","anya"," dun","ia"," tid","ak"," b","ers","ah","ab","at"," deng","an"," k","ita",".","\n","S","ak","it"," gig","i"," ad","al","ah"," se","per","ti"," u","j","ian"," unt","uk"," m","eng","u","ji"," k","es","ab","aran"," yang"," ras","anya"," tid","ak"," b","isa"," di","ung","kap","kan"," deng","an"," k","ata","-","k","ata",".","\n","Kal","au"," k","